                                    Table "public.supplier_feed"
     Column     |           Type           | Collation | Nullable |             Default              
----------------+--------------------------+-----------+----------+----------------------------------
 feed_id        | integer                  |           | not null | generated by default as identity
 feed_date      | date                     |           | not null | 
 book_id        | integer                  |           | not null | 
 supplier_price | integer                  |           | not null | 
 supplier_stock | integer                  |           | not null | 
 received_at    | timestamp with time zone |           | not null | 
Indexes:
    "supplier_feed_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (feed_id)

                         Table "public.book_supply"
     Column     |           Type           | Collation | Nullable | Default 
----------------+--------------------------+-----------+----------+---------
 book_id        | integer                  |           | not null | 
 supplier_price | integer                  |           | not null | 
 supplier_stock | integer                  |           | not null | 
 updated_at     | timestamp with time zone |           | not null | 
Indexes:
    "book_supply_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (book_id)
Check constraints:
    "book_supply_supplier_price_check" CHECK (supplier_price > 0)
    "book_supply_supplier_stock_check" CHECK (supplier_stock >= 0)
Foreign-key constraints:
    "book_supply_book_id_fkey" FOREIGN KEY (book_id) REFERENCES books(book_id)
[exit 0]